{"title":"2008 Mock ARML 2 Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_2_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/e/54e69db5a411d22e710513e667c4a1c1dde77537.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{i = 0}^{n}a_ia_{n - i} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"110\" height=\"48\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/0/110f204340ba9592e19fb69a5bb75d18fea2a4f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" /> for all non-negative integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, evaluate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/9/cd9edb5df4e8a380c40c50e9e8a4490df39bdd6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{j = 0}^{\\infty}\\frac {a_j}{2^j}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"47\" height=\"50\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_2_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The motivating factor for this solution is the form of the first summation, which might remind us of the expansion of the coefficients of the product of two polynomials (or <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Generating_functions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Generating functions\">generating functions</a>). \n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be an arbitrary number; note that \n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/b/7bb6ab2c660599307d7ea9e7833b15383a114efb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left[\\sum_{j = 0}^{\\infty} a_jx^j\\right]^2 = (a_0 + a_1 \\cdot x + a_2 \\cdot x^2 + \\cdots)^2\\\\ = a_0^2 + (a_0a_1 + a_1a_0)x + (a_0a_2 + a_1a_1 + a_2a_0)x^2 + \\cdots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"416\" height=\"80\" /></center>\n<p>By the given, the coefficients on the right-hand side are all equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, yielding the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometric_series\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Geometric series\">geometric series</a>:\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/d/a1df83022460cfdef2f4aa2f07fe4381d8738873.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left[\\sum_{j = 0}^{\\infty} a_jx^j\\right]^2  = 1 + x + x^2 + \\cdots = \\frac{1}{1-x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -25px\" width=\"312\" height=\"61\" /></center>\n<p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/f/a2ff20448834be77dc325234211669d2b44d35aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" />, this becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/8/e5869b296154fed66b55a625cad04826b05d1393.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left[\\sum_{j = 0}^{\\infty}\\frac {a_j}{2^j}\\right]^2 = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"110\" height=\"57\" />, and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/8/1686806cd9c6194fd4e2e929dbd38bbb97c6ba34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\sqrt{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"36\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_2_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_2\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 2\">2008 Mock ARML 2</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_2_Problems\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 2 Problems\">Problems</a></b>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t=206880\">Source</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_2_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 2 Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b>Final Question</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_2_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 2 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_2_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 2 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_2_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 2 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_2_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 2 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_2_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 2 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_2_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 2 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_2_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 2 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">8</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017175717\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.023 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.069 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 109/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 952/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 77/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2295/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   42.470      1 Template:Mock_ARML_box\n100.00%   42.470      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:6953:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017175717 and revision id 78756. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}